@startuml
title GoF Pattern : Observer+Command+Memento

note as GoFLabel
  **<<Observer+Command+Memento>>**
end note

class Document {
  + getContent(): String
  + setContent(content: String): void
}
class DocumentMemento {
  - content: String
  + getSavedContent(): String
}
class DocumentCaretaker {
  - mementos: List<DocumentMemento>
  + saveState(document: Document): void
  + restoreState(index: int): void
}
interface EditorView {
  + update(): void
}
class Toolbar {
  + update(): void
}
class StatusBar {
  + update(): void
}
class PreviewPanel {
  + update(): void
}
interface Command {
  + execute(): void
  + undo(): void
}
class EditDocumentCommand {
  - document: Document
  + execute(): void
  + undo(): void
}
class Editor {
  - views: List<EditorView>
  - caretaker: DocumentCaretaker
  + attach(view: EditorView): void
  + detach(view: EditorView): void
  + notify(): void
}

Document --> DocumentMemento : creates
DocumentCaretaker --> DocumentMemento : stores
Toolbar ..|> EditorView
StatusBar ..|> EditorView
PreviewPanel ..|> EditorView
Editor --> EditorView : notifies
EditDocumentCommand ..|> Command
EditDocumentCommand --> Document : modifies
GoFLabel .. Document
@enduml